<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Shorewood Packaging.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Shorewood Packaging.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Bear Stearns confirmed it initiated coverage of Shorewood Packaging Corp as attractive.</p>
<p>-- said it set fiscal 1997 earnings estimate of $1.30 a share and fiscal 1998 estimate of $1.50 a share.</p>
<p>-- set a 12-month price target in the &quot;mid-20s&quot;</p>
<p>-- Shorewood gained 1/4 to 18-5/8 in morning trading.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
